tooltip_text = "Julia set
Iterate z(n+1) = z(n)^2 + c, starting each pixel at z(0).
The fixed complex value c determines the set.

C Real: sets Re(c), reshaping and reconnecting the lobes.
C Imag: sets Im(c), changing symmetry and branching."
